sequenceDiagram
	autonumber
	participant Browser as Customer Browser
	participant Gateway as API Gateway
	participant Commerce as Commerce Zone
	participant Storefront as Storefront Zone
	participant Entra as Microsoft Entra ID

	Browser ->> Gateway: Request protected shopping route
	Gateway ->> Commerce: Forward to Commerce zone
	Commerce -->> Browser: Redirect to sign-in with return URL
	Browser ->> Gateway: Request customer sign-in
	Gateway ->> Storefront: Forward to Storefront auth handler
	Storefront ->> Entra: OAuth2 / OIDC authentication handoff
	Entra -->> Storefront: Identity tokens and claims
	Storefront -->> Browser: Origin-scoped session cookie + redirect
	Browser ->> Gateway: Retry protected route with session cookie
	Gateway ->> Commerce: Forward authenticated request
	Commerce -->> Browser: Render protected Commerce page
